 tavion davidson  officer burr and simmons arrived at the  mobile home park observed davidson  walking towards the front of the  entrance of the complex  officer burr  engaged davidson in a conversation and  eventually asked him to face a parked  car in order to conduct a weapons pat  down  instead of complying with the officer's  request davidson ran away  from both officers  both officers  gave chase and officer burr observed  davidson pull a firearm  as he was running away  officer burr told davidson several times  to drop the gun but davidson ignored  those commands and continued to run  during the foot pursuit davidson stopped  and turned towards  officer burr and fired one round at him  both officers returned i'm sorry both  officer burr and simmons returned fire  striking davidson  davidson continued to flee from the  officers and jumped a small chain-link  fence at which point he fell to the  ground and surrendered  officers arrived on scene  at which time davidson was taken into  custody without further incident  davidson was provided first aid  by the officers until paramedics arrived  at the scene  he was then transported to umc trauma  and treated for non-life-threatening  injuries  davidson has been booked in abstentia  for the aforementioned charges  i will now show you two  body worn camera videos of the  officer-involved shooting  where are you heading to  where you headed to  which one's your house  the first one  can i talk to you for a minute come on  over here  what's that  what's that  all right come on over here face the car  let me make sure you don't have any  weapons  [Applause]  444 shots fired he's running northbound  you'll see in this slow down version of  the suspect crouching down  and firing at the officer  there's a little better picture of it  this is a video from the second officer  [Applause]  again this one you can see as  the suspect runs away still has a  firearm in his hand  okay this concludes the briefing are  there any questions about how far was  the suspect from the officer at the time  uh i think that was about 24-25 feet  yes he fired one round in that still  picture that shows him in the low ready  position and he's firing at the officer  you can actually see the smoke from the  firearm as he shot at the officer  yes sir  good question yes the uh the round that  was fired  uh by the suspect actually struck a  trailer that's directly behind the  officer and there was a person inside  what about the ones that were  behind the subject  was behind the suspect there was some a  trash can and i think an eve at the very  top of the trailer up there that was  struck  yes after the shooting this is him  running away after the shooting  the second mail we did arrest a second  person but we still are not  completely sure if he was the one that  was uh involved in this event we're  still in the process of  interviewing witnesses and  he's not being cooperative the  non-life-threatening injuries were they  due to the fall  the non-life-threatening injuries were  from gunshots that he received yesterday  yes mr davidson was connected to trailer  number one which was uh nearest the  entrance to the park  uh we'll release that information at the  conclusion of the interview here and  you'll all be provided with with that  suspicious activity you didn't live in  that  did you get details  yes the suspicious activity was that the  male was walking through the complex  holding a firearm  so this is an extraordinary display of  bravery by our officers and i want to  make sure we pointed that out  unfortunately we continue to deal with  this sort of violence against police  officers across the country and  certainly here in las vegas  and we were able to apprehend the  suspect safely  before he was able to hurt anybody in  the complex so thank you all for your  time and if you have any other questions  you can contact the cio
 

